  "summary": "Software Engineer focused on building clean, reliable, and user-friendly interfaces in large React applications. I enjoy improving code clarity, simplifying complex UI flows, and delivering consistent, maintainable features.\n\nWhile my core strength is frontend development, I regularly work across APIs and databases, including creating new tables, writing stored procedures, and supporting full feature delivery from UI to data layer. I collaborate closely with product and backend teams to deliver thoughtful solutions that improve both user and developer experience.\n\nMy strengths include reusable component architecture, test stability using Cypress and React Testing Library, SQL development, and contributing to well-structured systems through clean, maintainable code. I’m passionate about continuous growth as an engineer and enjoy tackling problems that make systems simpler and more reliable.",
